				<wikidot:authorName>fieldstone</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1436137</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I miss the &quot;everyday object that causes horrible thing to happen to you&quot; phase. There was a time when browsing SCP articles would make everyday life unsettling, because it would feel like your toothbrush could turn your saliva into centipedes or your car keys could burrow into you and take over your body. I can see how it's grown beyond that as a writing project, but the articles like this make me nostalgic for the days when the wiki was more concentrated paranoia fuel.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
