					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-225463#post-2384722</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-225463/scp-611#post-2384722</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2015 16:17:36 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Myriad</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>101948</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You know, the writing here is great, and the picture just makes me cringe and want to go immediately to the dentist&#8230;. But it seems very barely anomalous. In fact, the article itself seems to imply that while the process of evolution that resulted in the species may be anomalous, the species itself isn't.</p> <p>I also think the death bits is overdone. As disturbing as this all is, the very nature of the infection should be enough to send most people screaming to the ER/Dentist, and the species doesn't seem particularly resistant to treatment.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
